      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You've trained as a spy in service of Taldor, learning secrets of disguise, manipulating crowds, and deceiving various sorts of magic users with ease. You likely dropped out of the Kitharodian Academy, Taldor's premier bardic college, in order to train at one of the Lion Blade's elite Shadow Schools."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
